    },
    {
        "text": "Wasserland, Leithanien"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$loading_intro",
        "key": "$loading_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_493_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_370_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "How do you like this piece?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiable Official"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Like an energetic child waking from slumber, rushing out the door to enjoy the fruits of life to the fullest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lateran Cleric"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It was the Kurf\u00fcrst who wrote it, inspired by His Holiness's visit to Wasserland when he was still a Messenger for Laterano.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiable Official"
    },
    {
        "text": "The young and enthusiastic future pontiff told the children about all that he has seen... the ocean that Iberia watches over, the city of Athenius, where Minoan myth and machination exist in equal measure.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiable Official"
    },
    {
        "text": "And... a passing mention of Kazdel, the city of sin, the whereabouts of which are unknown.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiable Official"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Kurf\u00fcrst was there, and he was fascinated by His Holiness's descriptions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiable Official"
    },
    {
        "text": "The first draft of this work was in fact written at that time, but the Kurf\u00fcrst was not satisfied. Even after many years of revisions, a final draft has yet to be completed...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiable Official"
    },
    {
        "text": "Until recently, when our scouts located the elusive nomadic city of the devils and sent back photos.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiable Official"
    },
    {
        "text": "Gazing upon the enormous tracks left behind by the city, the Kurf\u00fcrst found the missing element in the music\u2014ferocity. With that, the work was complete.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiable Official"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You found Kazdel?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lateran Cleric"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes. The Kurf\u00fcrst was astonished to find that the destiny of the work was intertwined with the city's.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiable Official"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand the reason the Kurf\u00fcrst chose to present this piece on the eve of my return to Laterano.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lateran Cleric"
    },
    {
        "text": "However, unlike his predecessors, His Holiness has no intention of initiating offensive action against the Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lateran Cleric"
    },
    {
        "text": "He is not interested in putting the sinless on trial without cause. I'm afraid I must disappoint the Kurf\u00fcrst.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lateran Cleric"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The city itself is of no concern to the Kurf\u00fcrst. He is far more interested in His Holiness's opinion of the piece.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiable Official"
    },
    {
        "text": "Please send His Holiness the Kurf\u00fcrst's warmest regards.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiable Official"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "200,0",
        "duration": 1,
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$doorknockquite",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1134_1#1$1",
        "posfrom": "200,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We have a response from Siracusa. Only a few of the famiglie have agreed to participate in the action. Their men will rendezvous with the fleet soon.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Courier"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I can't believe Laterano rejected us... Inform the Siracusans to move quickly. We must mop up the city before the other kreise can react.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiable Official"
    },
    {
        "text": "Take Kazdel before the other Kurf\u00fcrsten can. Do not repeat the mistake we made at Gaul and miss another opportunity.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiable Official"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "49_g9_cyclopsroom",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
