    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Scar Market, Kazdel"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1294_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I like Leithanians. You always bring so much business.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scareye"
    },
    {
        "text": "And it's smart that you disguised yourself as a prisoner in a smuggling crew, rather than flying the banner of a Messenger.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scareye"
    },
    {
        "text": "Now tell me what you want, before I lose my patience.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scareye"
    },
    {
        "text": "Trade, muscle for hire, intel... The Scar Market has everything you need.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scareye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Cooperation, esteemed leader.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nervous Envoy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1294_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We don't have a fixed price for 'cooperation'.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scareye"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you sure your Kurf\u00fcrst can pay my price?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scareye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don\u2019t you want to know what we're asking for first?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nervous Envoy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1294_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "There's nothing that money cannot buy here, Caprinae.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scareye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What about Kazdel?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nervous Envoy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1294_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...Go on.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scareye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_492_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Kurf\u00fcrst wants you to sabotage the city's propulsion system, nothing else.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nervous Envoy"
    },
    {
        "text": "The down-payment is in the safe that you took from the caravan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nervous Envoy"
    },
    {
        "text": "The Kurf\u00fcrst will discuss the rest of the payment with you in Kazdel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nervous Envoy"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1294_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I admire your boldness. Let me express my good faith with a little glimpse into the future for you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scareye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
