    },
    {
        "text": "The nomadic city of Kazdel, Kazdel"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_932_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Take your things and scram, Leithanian! Are you trying to poison me?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Sarkaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_499_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "These are just suppressants. You'll need them on the battlefield...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dejected Babel Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_932_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The warships that surround us came from Leithanien!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Sarkaz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Outsiders like you must have led them here!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Sarkaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_932_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_499_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "posfrom": "50,0",
        "posto": "-30,0",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I don't have an explanation. I know you're taking your son with you into battle. He could use the medicine\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dejected Babel Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bodyfalldown2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
