        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "posfrom": "-30,0",
        "posto": "100,0",
        "duration": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.31
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "posfrom": "50,0",
        "posto": "-50,0",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.51
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Keep your hands off my son!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Sarkaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1305_1#7$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1305_1#4$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the commotion\u2014are you out of your mind? She's a Babel doctor!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Goodluck"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bodyfalldown3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "-100,0",
        "duration": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "posfrom": "-100,0",
        "posto": "-200,0",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "-100,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1305_1#8$1",
        "focus": "m"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you okay?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Goodluck"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm fine. He wasn't really trying to hurt me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dejected Babel Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_932_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph. Goodluck.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Sarkaz"
    },
    {
        "text": "You married a Babel woman, and now you've become a shill for the invaders? They'll be the death of you, I guarantee it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Sarkaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_499_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Many of us are also pained by the impending war...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dejected Babel Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "We've requested to join you on the frontlines.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dejected Babel Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_932_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Sarkaz"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lunatics... who knows what schemes you have on the frontline... you'll get yours in the end...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Angry Sarkaz"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "-200,0",
        "duration": 1,
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$rungeneral"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1305_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_499_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Give me the medicine. I'll distribute it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Goodluck"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're ready to leave. Go meet up with them. I'll take care of things here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Goodluck"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_499_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Goodluck, your son...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dejected Babel Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1305_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I didn't let him leave.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Goodluck"
    },
    {
        "text": "If the Leithanians want to force us into a Catastrophe, it's safer for him to be in the lower-level shelters in the city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Goodluck"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_499_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dejected Babel Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1305_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Relax, doctor. People have made it through Catastrophes in the past. Maybe we'll have, you know, good luck!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Goodluck"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "49_g5_furnaceplatform",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_churchfire",
        "loop": true,
        "channel": "bgs",
        "volume": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "soundvolume",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$katzdale_intro",
        "key": "$katzdale_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "text": "The furnace has burned for more than a century."
    },
    {
        "text": "War, Catastrophe, migration, exile... all the suffering since the Teekaz era has not extinguished the hatred of the revenants."
    },
    {
        "text": "The Sarkaz have seen many Kazdels through the ages. The memory of yesterday may be unrecognizable by tomorrow..."
    },
    {
        "text": "But the Soul Furnace has been a constant for this generation of Sarkaz."
    },
    {
        "text": "Home is where the Soul Furnace is."
    },
    {
        "text": "Kazdel."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#2$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#2$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "The furnace has not burned like this for many years. I can hear the cries of the revenants even from here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Soon, this city will charge headlong into a Catastrophe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "All we need to do is hold out until Nezzsalem's reinforcements arrive, until Kazdel once again passes through the Catastrophe\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "They thought we would cower. They tried to assume our thoughts with their conception of common sense. It was so a hundred and seventy years ago, and it is so now.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "text": "Arrogant and laughable fools who never took the time to truly understand us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What fate do you think awaits this city, Theresis?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "To be honest, the chances that it survives are slim.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kazdel was immobilized the last time it braved a Catastrophe. It took us a decade just to get it moving at full speed again.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "text": "And the forests of crystals in the mines and on the walls could never be removed, ruining years of our plans for the city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "I don't know if the city can survive another ordeal like that, much less one that's even worse. Good luck rarely comes twice.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "left",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I believe in this city, Theresis.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not because of luck, but because we built this city, and I won't give up on it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "The story of this city does not end here, Your Highness.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "I may not be able to see its future clearly, but there is one thing I can say for sure\u2014the city continues to exist into the distant future.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "text": "No one can say, however, if it will be a sanctuary of hope, or a ghost city of the dead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "???"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "right",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Scareye... have you not grown tired of the ambiguous words of your kind?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "text": "And need I remind you that no amount of mercenaries can ensure your safety in this city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1294_1#1$1",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "There is no deceiving Your Highnesses, of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scareye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Kazdel's doors are open to every Sarkaz, but you'd better have a good reason to set foot in this city with your mercenaries at a time like this.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1294_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I was made an offer most difficult to refuse, which obliged me to enter the city to seek an audience.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scareye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What is that you're carrying?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1294_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This? Something insignificant. Oh, I mean some<b>one</b>. The Leithanians wanted me to sabotage Kazdel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scareye"
    },
    {
        "text": "I have been away from my kin for many years, but as your Highness said, Kazdel is the root of all Sarkaz.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scareye"
    },
    {
        "text": "So, I felt that I had to deliver this Leithanian with my own hands, in order to prove my innocence.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scareye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What are you thinking?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1294_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Exactly as I have said. What can I possibly hide before the King of Sarkaz?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scareye"
    },
    {
        "text": "But if you're not interested in my gift of good faith, then I see no need to carry it with me anymore. It's heavy, after all.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scareye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "He casually casts the bag into the furnace, where it is incinerated in an instant."
    },
    {
        "text": "Without a sound."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1294_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "The furnace is always an impressive sight, no matter how many times one sees it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scareye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1296_1#2$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresa"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1294_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Your Highness need not pity him. He should have foreseen the risks when he approached the Scar Market.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scareye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I trust Leithanien was not miserly with its terms.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1294_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's simple, Your Highness. I prefer immediate payment over empty promises. But more importantly, I don't work with the losing side.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scareye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you predicting our victory?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1294_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It wasn't I who saw it. It was the Cyclops who left the prophecy a thousand years ago. I'm simply betting that Your Highnesses are the protagonists of the prophecy.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scareye"
    },
    {
        "text": "Regardless, the safest business for the Scar Market is with Your Highnesses. It would keep business flowing for at least the next fifty years or so.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scareye"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is that not so, Your Highnesses?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Scareye"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1297_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're clever. Prophecy doesn't bring victory, but we can. Bring your mercenaries. We're moving out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Theresis"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopmusic",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "stopsound",
        "channel": "bgs",
        "fadetime": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "image": "49_g2_kazdelstreet_d",
        "screenadapt": "coverall"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$distressed_intro",
        "key": "$distressed_loop",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The crowd stirs."
    },
    {
        "text": "The Sarkaz procession leaving the city is quiet, except for the occasional clang of weapons and equipment."
    },
    {
        "text": "Their silence is rooted in the knowledge of the fate that awaited them beyond the city\u2019s gates."
    },
    {
        "text": "They wrap banners, torn from the walls, around their waists, or clutch Originium spikes, chopped from the streets, as makeshift weapons..."
    },
    {
        "text": "Each has their own ritual to remember the city that they may never return to."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1303_1#8$1",
        "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Mom... Dad, where are you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lost Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Dad! Mom!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lost Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_935_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "posfrom": "100,0",
        "posto": "0,0",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.4
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bodyfalldown2",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 15,
        "ystrength": 15,
        "vibrato": 20,
        "randomness": 70,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1303_1#8$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "-50,0",
        "duration": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.31
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$bodyfalldown1",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "posfrom": "-50,0",
        "posto": "-50,-70",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "afrom": 1,
        "ato": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_935_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hmph... people really need to watch their kids. They can\u2019t be allowed to run wild.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Indifferent Woman"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "posfrom": "0,0",
        "posto": "-150,0",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Ouch...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lost Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1302_1#7$1",
        "duration": 0.7,
        "posfrom": "80,0",
        "posto": "-50,0"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Careful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "posfrom": "-50,0",
        "posto": "-50,-50"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_avg_clothmovement",
        "volume": 0.6
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1302_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "posfrom": "-50,-50",
        "posto": "-50,0"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1303_1#8$1",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "posfrom": "0,-50",
        "posto": "0,0"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1303_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Th-Thank you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lost Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1302_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Where did you come from? Why are you also leaving the city? You'll fall if you\u2019re not careful.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1303_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm looking for my mom and dad. Are you going out, too?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lost Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1302_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes... I'm going to the battlefield.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1303_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you looking for your mom and dad there, too? Can I come with you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lost Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1302_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No... I'm by myself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1303_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Why are you going out, then?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lost Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1302_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Because I don't want to hide in the city. I want to fight the people who are doing bad things to us. That's what my parents told me before they... they left.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1303_1#8$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... I want to fight, too, but Mom and Dad won't let me go. I tried to sneak out and got a beating when they found out. But I don't want to be away from Mom and Dad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lost Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1302_1#8$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1302_1#10$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll go together then, and find your mom and dad. But there'll be a lot of bad people out there. Are you scared?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1303_1#9$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're not scared. Mom and Dad aren't scared. I'm not scared either!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lost Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "text": "The disheveled child pumps his fists to show courage, but his trembling betrays him."
    },
    {
        "text": "The older child knows that the young boy does not fully understand what is happening outside the city."
    },
    {
        "text": "But the young boy knows something simple but true."
    },
    {
        "text": "Bad guys should be chased away. Families should stay together. So he takes the boy's hand, and joins the procession."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1303_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1302_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "How do we find your parents when we're out there?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1303_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "They work for Babel. They have a picture of a tower on their clothes.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lost Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1302_1#2$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Babel. I know that place.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1303_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Are you from Babel too?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lost Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1302_1#1$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "No, I grew up in a Military Commission institution. I guess I'm from the Military Commission.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avg_npc_1303_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Military Commission? What's that?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lost Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avg_npc_1302_1#4$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "A place that protects people, just like Babel.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2.5
    },
    {
        "text": "What's your dad's name? Let's squeeze our way to the front. Maybe they're up ahead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Goodluck!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lost Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Good luck?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yes, he's Goodluck... why are you laughing?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lost Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nothing... let's shout his name. Maybe he'll hear you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Brave Child"
    },
    {
        "text": "Two children squeeze forward in the procession, holding each other's hand, calling out 'Goodluck' with their tiny voices."
    },
    {
        "text": "A few heads turn, and sigh when they see the young and naive faces."
    },
    {
        "text": "<i>Good luck</i>."
    },
    {
        "text": "It is what they all need."
    },
