    {
        "text": "On an evening in the autumn of 1068, the music playing in the Kurf\u00fcrst of Wasserland's study was interrupted by the sound of frantic knocking on the door."
    },
    {
        "text": "The fleet that was pursuing the nomadic city of Kazdel had broken off its pursuit."
    },
    {
        "text": "'Those crazy devils charged straight into a Catastrophe. It's only by sheer good luck that they got away.'"
    },
    {
        "text": "Years later, the Kurf\u00fcrst of Wasserland still recounted the reason for his failure with palpable disdain."
    },
